// One JSON object per line. Blank lines and // comments are ignored.
// The title/artist/aliases here are YOURS — canonical, correctly accented.
// The YouTube URL is only an audio source; its title is never read.
//
// anchor: "hook"  = deterministic point 30-45% in (DEFAULT). Vietnamese pop
//                    usually opens with a generic instrumental intro, so a clue
//                    taken from the start is unguessable. This clears it.
//         "intro" = just past leading silence, i.e. the song's real opening.
//         "body"  = loudness-step heuristic aiming at the vocal entry.
//                   Experimental and unvalidated — listen before trusting it.
// start_at: exact offset in seconds. Beats every mode; use it once you have
//           heard a clip and know where the identifiable part is.
// ladder:   this song's reveal steps in seconds, at most 5, e.g. [0.5, 2, 8, 16].
//           Overrides --ladder. Give a hard song a longer first clue.
// tier:     how well known the song is — the difficulty it appears under:
//           easy | medium | hard | expert | impossible. Untagged plays as medium.
//           Editing it later needs no rebuild: re-run ingest and it is applied.
